Would you like to learn the controls?
- YESS!
- Yes
Walk on red square to start\
Left click - Attack\
Q - Special Ability\
E - Ultimate Ability
I - Inventory\
Shift - Dodge ( 5 sec cooldown)\
B - Recall back to hub (no point for now)
1. Kill enemies\
2. Once purple bar is full Lclick chest and it will open\
3. choose item and put in inventory. press I to close inventory\
4. Repeat step 1
